            <title>[IGNITE-383] rename configuration properties: preload to rebalance</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-383</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Also pull &lt;tt&gt;forceRepartition()&lt;/tt&gt; to public API, but rename it to &lt;tt&gt;forceRebalancing()&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
