                            <comment id="14352109" author="dsetrakyan" created="Sun, 8 Mar 2015 16:00:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I am thinking that `forceRebalancing()` should just be `rebalance()`. I am not really sure what value the word &quot;force&quot; is adding.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14353653" author="yzhdanov" created="Mon, 9 Mar 2015 21:32:37 +0000"  >&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;i am not sure if &lt;tt&gt;preloadmode&lt;/tt&gt; enum should be renamed. pls ask on meeting and comment here&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;forceRepartition() -&amp;gt; rebalance()&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="14353670" author="dsetrakyan" created="Mon, 9 Mar 2015 21:38:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I think `CachePreloadMode` should be renamed to `CacheRebalanceMode`. Otherwise it would not be consistent.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
